<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS FLAT, THEN RISES.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS FLAT, THEN RISES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened flat at $65-7/8 in New York on Thursday and soon rose to $66-1/8.</p>
<p>The later price corresponded to about 339.30 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
